--- /dev/null
+++ b/tests/AGENTS.md
@@ -0,0 +1,30 @@
+# Workspace export tests
+
+## Key Files
+| File | Purpose |
+| --- | --- |
+| `test_export_manifest.py` | Pure Python regression tests for paths, partial exports, conflicts, rollback and external edits |
+| `blender_workspace_accept.py` | Real OWOTS import baseline and single-vertex incremental export acceptance |
+| `blender_workspace_textures.py` | Image-format conversion, packed/dirty pixels, partial PAK and revert acceptance |
+| `blender_workspace_edges.py` | 2048px streaming/base output, decoded RGBA, DDS, node reconnection, operators and legacy recovery |
+| `blender_workspace_mdf.py` | MDF scalar/color/vector updates, preview-node synchronization and revert cleanup |
+| `blender_owots_mdf_metadata.py` | OWOTS header/material metadata retention, legacy source recovery, authored-path preservation and missing-source guard |
+| `blender_baseline_texture_paths.py` | Current-scene edited NRRO routing toggle, original streaming/base paths and unchanged MDF/baseline validation |
+| `blender_empty_mesh.py` | Selected-only placeholder conversion, shared-mesh isolation, materials/transforms and real OWOTS skinning/export validation |
+| `blender_workspace_image_state.py` | Concurrent external/pixel edits and save/reopen preservation of dirty images |
+| `blender_import_baseline_errors.py` | Import baseline validation never opens export dialogs; manual validation remains active and preserves weights |
+| `blender_workspace_scene_scope.py` | Selected Outliner parent/mesh expansion, deduplication, MDF dependencies and no-selection scope |
+| `blender_workspace_force_mesh.py` | Force mode bypasses failed mesh baselines, includes unchanged selected meshes, validates outputs and preserves baseline records |
+| `blender_workspace_force_mdf.py` | Forced MDF output after reimport, failed MDF baseline compatibility, ambiguous sibling rejection and baseline preservation |
+| `blender_export_dialog_latency.py` | Dialog open/toggles never plan assets; explicit checking and subprocess failure containment |
+| `blender_export_crash_regression.py` | Isolated full scene export with native Mesh/MDF reread and TEX mip validation, including streaming/base pairs |
+| `blender_texture_policy.py` | TEX channel/color policy across dirty/packed/file/DDS/resized images; OWOTS multi-material null binding behavior |
+| `blender_owots_null_scene.py` | Applies defaults to captured scene MDF slots in an isolated Blender scene and verifies coverage/idempotence |
+
+## Dependencies
+- Standard-library unittest for manifest tests; Blender 5.2 for integration acceptance.
+
+## Common Patterns
+- Run `python -m unittest discover -s tests` from the repository root.
+- Run Blender scripts in order with `-- --output <validation-directory>`; the first also requires `--source <original-OWOTS-mesh>`. The companion Asset Library checkout must be available for PAK tests. Tests use a body material with a BC7 texture and its base/streaming pair.
+- Game samples and generated workspaces belong outside Git, under the workspace `_validation` directory.
